abstract: >-
  A framework-agnostic IIIF Presentation API 2.x, 3.0 & 4.0 viewer built with 
  OpenSeadragon, Three.js, MapLibre GL JS, and Tailwind CSS v4. Designed for museums, 
  archives, libraries, and digital heritage platforms to display deep-zoom 2D 
  canvases, interactive 3D .glb/.gltf scenes, tables of contents, metadata, 
  annotations, and geographic locations
